OL,5,G1300 Classical Live
OL,6,     FMark Forrest introduces highlights
OL,7,     Ffrom the Proms including music by
OL,8,     FRachmaninov plus chamber
OL,9,     Fperformances from this years
OL,10,     FRyedale Festival and Baroque music
OL,11,     Ffrom Fribourg.
OL,12,G1600 Composer of the Week: Mozart
OL,13,     FKate Molleson continues her survey
OL,14,     Fof five figures that shaped
OL,15,     FMozart's life and work. Today -
OL,16,     Fthe great villain of classical
OL,17,     Fmusic, Antonio Salieri: his
OL,18,     Farch-rival. Or was he?
OL,19,G1700 In Tune
OL,20,     FMaximilian Hornung plays live.
OL,21,     FCharles Hazelwood on
OL,22,     FParaorchestra's BBC prom.
